# Survivor X™ (#007)

Third **flagship** — reinvent Survivor, don't clone office pools.

## Core rules

One NFL team per week · Win = survive · Loss = out (unless **Survivor Shield™** auto-saves once) · **Never reuse a team** · Last standing wins.

## Modes

Classic · Double Life · Turbo · Global · Private (invite + custom fees).

## Weekly loop

Tue open → lock before kickoff → live survival map → MNF final survivors.

## Platform

Publish via EventEngine — never call Reward/Legacy/Live directly from pick handlers.

## Eliminated players

Always route to side XP, drops, Squares, Pick'em — never dead-end.

Full spec: `docs/SURVIVOR_X.md` · Shields: `docs/SURVIVOR_SHIELDS.md`
